# Injectable

`lib/shared/di/di.dart` holds `final get = GetIt.instance`. `lib/di/di.dart` generates registration:

```dart
@InjectableInit()
Future<void> configureDependencies() => get.init();
```

`App` awaits `configureDependencies()` before building the router.

```dart
@LazySingleton()
class NewsRepository { /* ... */ }

@Injectable()
class LoadNewsUC {
  LoadNewsUC(this._newsRepository);
  final NewsRepository _newsRepository;
}
```

- `@LazySingleton()` for repositories and long-lived services
- `@Injectable()` for use cases and blocs (a new bloc per page)
- Constructor parameters are the dependencies. injectable fills them.
- Async setup uses `@PostConstruct(preResolve: true)` (see `NewsRepository.init`)
- After adding or changing annotations, run `fvm dart run melos run build_runner --no-select`
- Widgets and `App` resolve with `get<T>()`. Repositories and use cases do not call `get`
